  "body": "If apartment living and a love of gardening are both on your wish list, then this is one you really need to see!\r\n\r\nPositioned on the podium level, this one-bedroom ground floor apartment offers something different. With a generous deck and an additional area of artificial lawn, there's plenty of room to potter in the garden, entertain or simply sit back and watch the birdlife. Adding to its appeal, you can access your apartment directly from outside through a private gate, offering an easy and independent way to come and go.\r\n\r\nThe apartment has views towards the greenspace of the orchard, while the garden has its own lovely outlook towards Eaves Bush - a peaceful spot to relax and unwind.\r\n\r\nInside, there's plenty of character, with Scandinavian style and a Kiwi twist. Warm laminated timber and tiled flooring create a relaxed and welcoming feel, while the west-facing position captures the afternoon sun, making your deck an especially inviting place to unwind at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nA secure car park within the building, along with a separate storage locker, completes the package, making this an ideal lock-and-leave option.\r\n\r\nTucked away from the street in a peaceful enclave within Kensington Park, you'll appreciate the lovely sense of privacy, while still being just an easy stroll to the local café and the beach.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the neighbourhood itself. Kensington Park has a friendly, welcoming feel that really needs to be experienced to be appreciated. Add to this the wonderful lifestyle amenities, including an indoor swimming pool, gym, sauna and beautifully landscaped gardens, and you have a very appealing place to call home.\r\nThere are other one-bedroom apartments within Kensington Park, but this one offers just that little bit extra - spacious outdoor living, room for a little gardening, afternoon sun and a lovely outlook.\r\n\r\nKensington Park Realty Ltd is Licensed Under REAA 2008",
